    "description": "KOMATSU MATERE Co.,Ltd. engages in the planning, development, manufacturing, and sale of synthetic fabrics and thin film fabrics in Japan and internationally. The company operates through Textile and Other Business segments. It is involved in the manufacture and sale of fabrics various apparel including fashion clothing, sportswear, and uniforms, as well as highly performance fabrics for a range of applications, including interiors, automotive interior materials, medical and welfare equipment, and electrical materials; and plan, propose, manufacture, and sell original products in the fields of fashion clothing, and sports wear. The company also offers Bellefomer, a sludge reduction bioformulation; CABKOMA, a carbon fiber composite and thermoplastic resin; mono-bo, sell bags and lifestyle goods. The company was formerly known as KOMATSU SEIREN Co.,Ltd. and changed its name to KOMATSU MATERE Co.,Ltd. in October 2018. KOMATSU MATERE Co.,Ltd. was incorporated in 1943 and is headquartered in Nomi, Japan."
